  "notes": "- Headshots count properly: a bullet that touches the head hitbox is now always a headshot. Before,\n  hits near the edge or top of the head were measured as body shots, so they did a third of the damage\n  (that's why the Longshot needed two \"headshots\" on round 4). This applies to every gun.\n- Longshot buffed: 300 damage (was 200), x4 for headshots (was x3), fires a little faster, and it\n  keeps full damage through every zombie it punches through. One-shots to the head up to about round 12,\n  and to the body in the early rounds.",
